> I'm not saying that you can't clean out shops without doing the PR, I'm
> saying that you must clean out shops to do the PR.

I would disagree.  If there are two main dungeon shops there may be
enough main dungeon $ to run directly to the priest and not stop at
any Minetown shops.  Another possibility is vault gold.  While it's
true that sometimes there is not enough gold in the main dungeon to
acquire full protection, it's not always a necessity to clear out the
Minetown shops.  It depends on what your XL is ($3200 is easier to
find than $6400 or $9600).  Although it's nice to know that they're
there, I have not found the Minetown shops to be a very safe place to
credit clone; very dangerous.  That said, if things seem safe I'll try
and sell out one store at a time, but one bat can ruin the whole run
while Fido is out getting killed by the watch captain.

